/**
* @file
* Namespace and other global documentation.
*/

/**
* @namespace bem
* @brief Primary namespace for the OpenBEM library.
*/

/**
* \defgroup geom Geometry
* @brief Geometry and mesh management classes and functions.
*/

/**
* \defgroup mesh Mesh
* \ingroup geom
* @brief Classes to store and operate on mesh data.
*/

/**
* \defgroup prim Geometry Primitives
* \ingroup geom
* @brief Classes to manage and operate on geometry primitives that compose a mesh.
*/

/**
* \defgroup kern Kernels
* @brief Classes for the computation of integral operator kernels (Green's functions) and their derivatives.
*/

/**
* \defgroup matr Matrix Types
* @brief Classes that wrap and provide an interface to third-party matrix algebra libraries.
*/

/**
* \defgroup quad Quadrature
* @brief Classes for computing numerical integration via quadrature over geometry primitives.
*/

/**
* \defgroup linequad Line Quadrature
* \ingroup quad
* @brief Classes for computing numerical integration via quadrature over line segments.
*/

/**
* \defgroup triquad Triangle Quadrature
* \ingroup quad
* @brief Classes for computing numerical integration via quadrature over triangles.
*/


/**
* @namespace bem::rwg
* @brief Namespace for RWG-based BEM functionality.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwg RWG
* @brief Classes for surface integral equation concepts associated with RWG-based meshes.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwgopint Operator Integration
* \ingroup rwg
* @brief Classes for computing RWG-based kernel-aware integration over source and observation triangles.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwgopintobs Observation Triangle
* \ingroup rwgopint
* @brief Classes for computing RWG-based kernel-aware integration over observation triangles.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwgopintsrc Source Triangle
* \ingroup rwgopint
* @brief Classes for computing RWG-based kernel-aware integration over source triangles.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwgops Operators
* \ingroup rwg
* @brief Classes defining element-wise computation of integral equation operators.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwgproj Projectors
* \ingroup rwg
* @brief Classes defining element-wise computation of integral equation projectors.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwgexc Excitations
* \ingroup rwg
* @brief Classes defining element-wise computation of integral equation excitations.
*/

/**
* \defgroup assm Matrix Assemblers
* \ingroup rwg
* @brief Classes for matrix assembly of integral equation operators, projectors, and excitations.
*/

/**
* \defgroup rwgie Integral Equations
* \ingroup rwg
* @brief Classes for assembling together all components of commonly used integral equations.
*/


/**
* @example ../examples/ex01_start_here.cpp
* Example 1: TEFIE and NMFIE solvers for closed PEC objects.
* Demonstrates the computation of bistatic RCS for a PEC sphere with
* two different integral equation formulations.
*/

/**
* @example ../examples/ex02_assemblers.cpp
* Example 2: Defining operators and assembling them into matrices for
* more customized integral equations.  Repeats the computations in
* Example 1, but with user-defined setup of the integral operators and
* their assembly into matrices, for more customization. Assumes
* knowledge from Example 1.
*/
